# Playwright E2E Rules
- Use the Page Object Model; page objects live in tests/e2e/pages/.
- Select elements by data-testid only. Never by text, CSS class, or XPath.
- No hard waits (no waitForTimeout). Use web-first assertions and auto-waiting locators.
- Reuse shared fixtures from tests/e2e/fixtures/; do not re-implement login or cart setup.
- One assertion theme per test; name tests by user outcome, not implementation.
- Test data comes from the data matrix, not inline literals.
